HST Office: the import's copy of a VBA project keeps the class of its storages.

Saving keeps the project read from a .doc, .docm or .xls, from a copy made through StorageBase, which has
names and bytes only: a Frame's storage lost its class. It is restored from the storage's CompObj, the same
value in every Office-made form file looked at, and the CompObj stays byte for byte.

